1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:04,986
Yesterday, pigeons. Today, obedience.

2
00:00:05,026 --> 00:00:07,217
The pigeons are still here.

3
00:00:07,257 --> 00:00:13,573
The Obedience Ray. One shot, and
everyone does exactly what I say.

4
00:00:13,613 --> 00:00:16,494
Three, two, one!

5
00:00:17,214 --> 00:00:20,748
People of Earth! Kneel before me!

6
00:00:21,218 --> 00:00:24,247
Oh, terribly sorry. After you.

7
00:00:24,287 --> 00:00:27,651
No, no, I insist. After you.

8
00:00:27,691 --> 00:00:29,527
I said kneel!

9
00:00:29,997 --> 00:00:33,938
Of course! Can I get you anything?
A cup of tea?

10
00:00:33,978 --> 00:00:35,884
He's very obedient.

11
00:00:35,924 --> 00:00:37,880
Stop being nice to me!

12
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:40,801
You're doing a wonderful job, love.

13
00:00:42,171 --> 00:00:46,184
About the rent, dear.
No rush at all.

14
00:00:46,224 --> 00:00:48,165
Leave it on.
